# Solana mainnet RPC endpoint. The public endpoint works for development but
# rate-limits getProgramAccounts; use a provider (Helius, Triton, QuickNode…)
# for anything beyond local testing. Never commit URLs containing API keys.
SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com

# Optional: enable governance diagnostics logging outside `next dev`.
# GOVERNANCE_DEBUG=1
